          "score": 73,
          "text": "Claude and ChatGPT have thinking efforts where you can tune the amount of thinking allowed.<p>Like low, medium, high, xhigh and so on.<p>But are they different models underneath? Or same model with different parameter?<p>The reason I ask is because, if I change the effort param mid conversation in Claude code, I get a warning suggesting I’m breaking the cache.<p>I don’t think this happens in Codex because when I change the effort, the responses are still quick.",
